Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Export to FORM", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"3daf1263-6d1b-4f34-871b-6459b0a42c50"],

Cell["\<\
How does export time depend on expression size and repetition?\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"5100bfc6-acf8-4b3b-a1c8-ba0d9f6c7913"],

Cell["\<\
Inputs vary repeated and distinct scalar products, propagators and symbols, \
momentum routing, and factorization. Quick uses 100 and 1,000 entries; Full \
also uses 5,000. Actual evaluated input sizes are recorded. No FORM process \
is required.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9ce709e6-9ab7-4326-8dbd-ab5b45f516b3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"993bd9bb-b874-4e17-befd-73581780df44"],

Cell["\<\
Use a fresh kernel for reproducible measurements. Mathematica, FeynGrav with \
FeynCalc, and FORM/TFORM are sufficient. No Python, shell scripts or external \
fixtures are needed. Opening this notebook does not execute any cells.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"205f05c0-038e-496b-90be-e7ac804339c4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

